— Authorizing the submission of an application by the City of Cheyenne
for state funding for the Office of State Lands and Investments Unmet Housing Grant.
(SPONSORS - DR. RINNE & MR. SEGRAVE)
Mr. White moved to adopt, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Mr. White moved to amend the 5”
WhEREAS to replace $1,000,000.00 with $500,000.00, seconded by Mr. Wolfe.
Motion to
amend carried by unanimous voice vote. Main motion, as amended, carried by unanimous voice
