Laramie
County
to
provide
funding
to
community
agencies
and
monitor
performance of community programs. (2019-2022 Optional 1% Sales Tax Fund)
Mr. White moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $100,000.00, seconded by Mr. Wolfe.
Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Vicki Nemecek, Public Works Director, provided a staff report. Kris Whitfield, Laramie County
United Way Executive Director/CEO, provided additional information related to the selection of
the programs. Committee member Emmons commented on the item and public comment was
made by Daffney Sandoval, Habitat for Humanity of Laramie County Development Director.
c)
Professional Services Agreement between the City of Cheyenne, Cheyenne
Metropolitan Planning Organization and Stantec Consulting Services Inc. for the
East Allison Road Corridor Study. (MPO Funds)
Mr. White moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $239,577.88, seconded by Mr. Wolfe.
Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Christopher Yaney, Metropolitan Planning Organization Director, provided a staff report.
